---
layout: base.njk
---
{#- Sections-driven page (R-SEC-06 alternation, R-SEC-10 reveal below the fold, R-SEC-12 data only).
    Front matter: sections: [ "sample-id" | { type, … } ]; demote: true turns section h1s into h2s (style guide only).
    The page's computed breadcrumbs travel in ctx so page-header can show them (R-SEC-08). Any template body renders before the sections.
    Pages with a title open with a page-header built from title, eyebrow and lede unless their first section is a hero or page-header. -#}
{% from "sections/_render.njk" import section %}
{{ content | safe }}
{%- set header = { eyebrow: eyebrow, title: title, lede: lede } if (title and not demote and not noHeader) else null -%}
{%- for step in sections | sectionsPlan(locale, page.url, site.brand.density, demote, breadcrumbs, header) %}
{{ section(step.s, step.ctx) }}
{%- endfor %}
